## Quality Checklist for Each Subject Line
- [ ] Under 60 characters
- [ ] Compelling and attention-grabbing
- [ ] Accurately reflects email content
- [ ] No spam trigger words
- [ ] Professional tone maintained
- [ ] Clear value proposition
- [ ] No personal pronouns
- [ ] Grammatically correct
- [ ] Mobile-friendly length
- [ ] Creates curiosity or highlights benefit

## Open Rate Predictions
- **High**: Strong curiosity gap or clear benefit
- **Medium**: Good value proposition but less compelling
- **Low**: Generic or less engaging

## Additional Considerations
- Test different approaches for your audience
- Consider email client preview limitations
- Balance creativity with clarity
- Align with overall brand voice
- Consider send time and context

